Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.72,0:00:14.72,Default,TIP,0,0,10,,{\fs65}{\fad(150,200)\an8}来源：官方字幕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.72,0:00:17.72,Default,TIP,0,0,10,,{\fs65}{\fad(150,200)\an8}润色：爪爪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.72,0:00:20.72,Default,TIP,0,0,10,,{\fs65}{\fad(150,200)\an8}压制：相簿、白、囧冏浻烱、120903
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs65\shad0\bord0\c&H7F6DFF&\pos(960,637.2)}爪爪字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.86,0:00:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我想把它装入我的体内
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,少开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.05,0:00:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你要卖这玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.47,0:00:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是来出售的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我想把它装入我的体内
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.68,0:00:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,少做梦了 这种军用植入体
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.39,0:00:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,没有天赋就别想了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你这种黄毛小子能承受的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.65,0:00:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我付钱就是 用不着你管这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.95,0:00:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,说得好像你付得起一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.16,0:00:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.37,0:00:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,慢着
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.15,0:00:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不如我们做个交易
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.92,0:00:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我来帮你装
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.59,0:00:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但是当它侵蚀到大脑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.84,0:00:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你哭着回来求我拆掉时 斯安威斯坦就归我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.06,0:00:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这个交易不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.04,0:02:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,在展会上 拉瓦布尔先生试图说服荒坂大人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.51,0:02:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫马丁内斯 很不幸 您已被登记迟到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.88,0:02:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们上课到一半…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.95,0:02:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他可真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.08,0:02:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是在学校
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.97,0:03:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,到处都是监控 你疯了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.22,0:03:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,害怕被拍到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.38,0:03:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,反正我不在意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.48,0:03:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.16,0:03:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.39,0:03:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,痛死了 你做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.73,0:03:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么植入物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.52,0:03:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,把我的鼻子打断了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.73,0:03:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.48,0:03:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸是学院理事会的高层
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.49,0:03:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,要让你退学还不简单吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.66,0:04:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.52,0:04:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他可真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.71,0:04:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸是学院理事会的高层
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.65,0:04:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,要让你退学还不简单吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.61,0:04:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,马库斯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.60,0:04:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要把我儿子被羞辱的视频展示给我看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.62,0:04:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这是大卫马丁内斯 今年17岁 圣多明戈人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.50,0:04:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,在校成绩优异
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.38,0:04:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不过前阵子发现他使用盗版装置
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.67,0:04:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,学院的系统因此遭到损毁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.09,0:04:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他没有父亲 其母近期因车祸过世
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.55,0:05:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,现在债台高筑…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.55,0:05:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我有什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.01,0:05:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,观察他的动作
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.26,0:05:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他身上装的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.39,0:05:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对是詹姆斯诺瑞斯死亡时拥有的斯安威斯坦型义体
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.02,0:05:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那个赛疯子的案子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.69,0:05:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.23,0:05:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但和那位前军士不同的是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.55,0:05:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这位学生植入后并没有出现副作用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他的耐力会让他成为「那个产品」的最佳实验人选
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.74,0:05:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此 他现在人在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.45,0:05:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他被退学了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,让他回来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.00,0:05:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,必要的话 就用钱打动他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.92,0:05:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那您的儿子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.34,0:05:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,万事要以公司利益为首
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.97,0:05:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,身为我的接班人 他也应当明白
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.30,0:05:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,224)}{\shad0\bord0\fs45\c&H2425A5&}校长
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.14,0:05:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,马丁内斯先生 你的退学申请已得到处理
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.39,0:05:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,田中先生的家长…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.07,0:06:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,懒得管了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.20,0:06:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,洗衣程序完成
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.21,0:07:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.75,0:07:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你有事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.09,0:07:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.09,0:07:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你在妨碍我工作
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.38,0:07:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,难道我要眼睁睁地看着 你偷走我的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.97,0:07:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才就一直看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.35,0:07:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,真没想到你是这种小偷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.69,0:08:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们见过面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.19,0:08:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 这应该是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.36,0:08:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看你安装了什么宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.61,0:08:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.76,0:08:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,乳臭未干的小孩竟然有斯安威斯坦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.65,0:08:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,还不是普通的型号
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.20,0:08:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会举报你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟这里是夜之城
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.85,0:08:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不如我们合作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.67,0:08:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,偷窃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.16,0:08:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,对象只限荒坂公司那些穿西装的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.02,0:08:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那我是什么 我长得像荒坂公司的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.96,0:08:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我的扫描仪显示了荒坂学院的学号
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.30,0:08:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但你说得对 你一点也不像
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.47,0:08:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我退学了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.02,0:08:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 问题少年啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.52,0:08:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你只偷荒坂的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.82,0:08:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,要加入吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.28,0:08:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你该感谢父母把你养得这么聪慧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.86,0:08:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是充满惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.51,0:08:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你还有许多要学的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.58,0:08:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我的分成是多少
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.99,0:09:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我八 你二
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.42,0:09:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要的斯安威斯坦可是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.92,0:09:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,但转移到手芯片的人是我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.65,0:09:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,而且还要算上拜我为师的学费
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.17,0:09:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,学费 真有一套
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.59,0:09:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我现在手头紧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.67,0:09:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,能六四分吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.18,0:09:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,七三分
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.59,0:09:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,工作结束立马付给你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.27,0:09:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.52,0:09:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么说定了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.48,0:09:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫露西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.07,0:09:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.11,0:09:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,连上了 你听得到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.99,0:09:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,听得到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.37,0:09:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我也听得到 目标是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.50,0:09:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,在3点钟方向
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.50,0:09:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.87,0:09:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,进入中…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.50,0:09:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好 准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.76,0:09:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,三 二 一 上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,成功
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.52,0:10:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才那是初级班 下一个来真的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.35,0:10:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.98,0:10:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那些聊得正欢的西装小姐毫无警觉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.73,0:10:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,在看超梦的也很好下手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.19,0:10:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,太简单了 入门级教学就不必了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.24,0:10:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题 现在要来重量级的了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.37,0:10:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.33,0:10:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是荒坂的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.33,0:10:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他是荒坂雇的保镖 三 二 ㄧ
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.09,0:10:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.89,0:10:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,很棒 重量级也挑战成功
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.88,0:10:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,下一站下车
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.60,0:10:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.81,0:10:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样 我能力还不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.02,0:10:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你分走两成的确值得
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.90,0:10:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是三成
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.40,0:10:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.84,0:10:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,要换别的车次继续吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.67,0:10:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,可能要换别的线路了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.37,0:10:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这时候应该有人察觉到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.70,0:10:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得把风险降到最低
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.58,0:11:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,情况有多糟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.91,0:11:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,新手很常见的错误
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.58,0:11:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,植入完毕后没有做任何防御措施
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.48,0:11:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他用什么免疫抑制剂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.84,0:11:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,有医保吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.55,0:11:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 看起来不像
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,有我能联系上的家人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.18,0:11:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,还是紧急联络人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.72,0:11:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,都说了 不知道 总该有父母吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.93,0:11:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,以前读荒坂学院
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.07,0:11:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,荒坂学院 难怪有钱装这个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.36,0:11:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.07,0:11:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.61,0:11:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,有点恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.41,0:11:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你用什么免疫抑制剂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.95,0:11:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.33,0:11:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,认真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.83,0:11:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.25,0:11:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 我们开过了…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.21,0:11:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.50,0:11:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这小屁孩身上的义体值不少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.47,0:11:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你保持沉默的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.31,0:12:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 你这是沦落到 要和清道夫合作的地步了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.35,0:12:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不高兴的话 我连你的植入体也一起要了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.34,0:12:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我们只好八二分了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.80,0:12:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.33,0:12:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.35,0:12:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.62,0:12:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.52,0:12:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,义体大夫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.85,0:12:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,带我去找义体医生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.66,0:13:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊 大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.59,0:13:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来糟透了 没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.12,0:13:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.66,0:13:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你用了几次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.00,0:13:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,六… 不对 八次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.38,0:13:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,一个成年人都受不了那种折磨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.22,0:13:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,原本好好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.68,0:13:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,突然开始流鼻血
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.01,0:13:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他竟然还不知道免疫抑制剂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.06,0:13:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我当时觉得没必要
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.53,0:13:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个坏家伙 快把药卖给他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.58,0:13:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不讲价 这药可贵了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.36,0:13:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.17,0:13:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你要跟我收钱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.61,0:13:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 已经免费帮你手术了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.74,0:13:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这些能买多少
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.74,0:13:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,两天的剂量
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.21,0:13:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就这点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不然就去找别的医生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.42,0:13:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但恐怕你迟早会回到清道夫手上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:14:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这个贪婪的王八蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.48,0:14:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你看来还没想拆掉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.05,0:14:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,还没
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.02,0:14:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,还是不敢相信 一天内用了八次
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.77,0:14:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定是皮太厚 或者…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.32,0:14:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不过一天别超过两次 最多三次
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.69,0:14:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,就算身体扛得住 脑袋肯定吃不消
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.86,0:14:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,一定会侵蚀你的人性
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.37,0:14:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说我可能变成赛博疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.66,0:14:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,单凭一个植入体就变成赛博疯子 这我可没听过
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.25,0:14:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这也算让你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.59,0:14:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那个东西有多危险了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.81,0:15:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,都好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.28,0:15:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,今天就到这吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.94,0:15:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我还可以继续
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.78,0:15:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,别想了 我可不想给赛博疯子当保姆
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.62,0:15:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,在必要时才能使用斯安威斯坦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.95,0:15:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,还有别的方法可以工作
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.71,0:15:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,经历了这么多事 你还想跟我合作吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.08,0:15:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,至少今天花出去的我得先赚回本吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.84,0:15:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想继续 我需要钱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么定了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.51,0:15:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定今晚就这样结束吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.86,0:15:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我快被房东赶出屋子了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.34,0:15:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,今天到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.73,0:15:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.63,0:15:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.16,0:15:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你还想继续
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.53,0:15:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,跟工作无关
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.91,0:15:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.49,0:15:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.58,0:15:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你一个人住吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.29,0:15:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.12,0:15:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.50,0:16:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你该不会是紧张吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.25,0:16:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.63,0:16:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.84,0:16:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,才不是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.42,0:16:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.26,0:16:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,随便坐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.16,0:16:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我只有啤酒 可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.23,0:16:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.02,0:16:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,干杯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.78,0:16:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗 连喝酒也是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.94,0:16:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我对酒精还好 只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.86,0:16:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不喜欢碳酸饮料和烟的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.87,0:16:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,现在还有这种人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.99,0:16:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有骗你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.56,0:16:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,太差劲了 你的衣服也很糟
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.79,0:16:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,脱掉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.75,0:16:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.30,0:16:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,听我的 快脱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.64,0:16:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.35,0:16:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不要在上面乱写
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.06,0:16:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,边缘人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.77,0:17:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,赛博朋克的别称
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.23,0:17:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你想成为这样的人 不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.27,0:17:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我是吉黑「边缘人」系列的铁粉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.23,0:17:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.61,0:17:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是又怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.19,0:17:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那张老土的海报又是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.41,0:17:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你有意见
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.24,0:17:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,没意见
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,广告总宣传令我反感的光鲜乐园
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.22,0:17:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 为了开发月球究竟牺牲了多少人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.01,0:17:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,比起乐园 更像暗无天日的地狱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.51,0:17:47.37,scr,,0,0,0,,{\fn思源黑体 heavy\org(1147.2,469.2)\frx10\fry2\frz348.1\pos(536,349.2)\c&HD79288&}全新生活即将开启
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.26,0:17:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你好像懂的很多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.01,0:17:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,荒坂学院留给我的教训 是广告上绝不会体现出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.06,0:17:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是上得起学院的纨绔子弟
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.64,0:17:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,才不是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.52,0:17:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,能读荒坂学院 足够证明你是个小少爷了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.40,0:17:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,并不是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.36,0:17:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有父亲 家里也没有钱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.53,0:17:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我就不应该读荒坂学院
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但是母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.36,0:18:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,非常辛劳 为了让我进那所学校而努力工作
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.37,0:18:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我早知道自己永远无法融入他们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.58,0:18:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那你为何在学院坚持了那么久
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.63,0:18:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法 我必须读学院 才能进入荒坂公司工作
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.64,0:18:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,爬上公司界的金字塔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.02,0:18:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,至少那是我母亲的愿望或梦想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.92,0:18:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是原因
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.66,0:18:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,可是那是别人的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.12,0:18:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,别人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.32,0:18:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你和你的母亲是两个不同的人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.91,0:18:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要为完成她的心愿而活
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.16,0:18:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这样错了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.16,0:18:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己的梦想 不该属于任何其他人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.66,0:18:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,说得好像你已经找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.63,0:18:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.83,0:18:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得那是地狱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.64,0:18:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可对我而言 这里才是地狱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.43,0:18:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.34,0:18:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想要远走高飞
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.98,0:19:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,带你看个东西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.91,0:19:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这分辨度太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.02,0:19:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳好热
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.88,0:19:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,它是通过你的个人链接 让你感觉到太阳的热度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.05,0:19:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 如果是真实的温度 你会被烤焦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.00,0:19:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我把它降到人类能承受的范围
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.30,0:19:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,要我关掉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这太好玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.55,0:19:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你那是什么姿势
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,还不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.61,0:19:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.32,0:19:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.69,0:19:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.73,0:21:13.20,scr,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\fn方正细圆_GBK\c&HB0BB73&\pos(1067.2,898)\frz24.77}无重力碳酸饮料
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.62,0:21:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我第一次带别人来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.41,0:21:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.71,0:21:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那为什么带我来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.17,0:21:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 我就是感觉可以带你来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.80,0:21:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.72,0:21:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们会是好搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.22,0:21:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.15,0:22:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你玩完了 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.45,0:22:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.41,0:22:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,小子 抱歉打扰了你的雅兴 但那个植入体是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.00,0:22:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,现在该物归原主了
Comment: 0,0:22:12.12,0:22:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.01,0:01:26.40,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}Eyes burning a way through me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.59,0:01:32.75,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}Eyes destroying so sweetly
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.00,0:01:39.30,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}Now there is a fire in me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.71,0:01:47.48,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}A fire that burns
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.85,0:02:16.54,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}This fire is out of control
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.54,0:02:17.34,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.34,0:02:18.19,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.19,0:02:19.01,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.01,0:02:20.40,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it down
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.67,0:02:30.47,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.47,0:02:31.32,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.32,0:02:32.14,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.14,0:02:33.53,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it down
Comment: 0,0:02:34.14,0:02:36.14,op-english,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.01,0:01:26.40,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}世人的眼光中我烈焰焚身
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.59,0:01:32.75,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}眼神中期盼着甜蜜杀戮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:39.30,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}现在我的心中燃起了一簇烈火
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.71,0:01:47.48,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}以我残躯化烈火
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.85,0:02:16.54,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}这簇失控的火焰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.54,0:02:17.34,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}让我把这座城市烧成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.34,0:02:18.19,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.19,0:02:19.01,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.01,0:02:20.40,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.67,0:02:30.47,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}让我把这座城市烧成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.47,0:02:31.32,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.32,0:02:32.14,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.14,0:02:33.53,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧成灰
Comment: 0,0:02:36.14,0:02:38.14,op-english,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.85,0:22:51.17,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}They will finally feel the flames
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.17,0:22:55.60,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Flames that run down through my veins
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.60,0:22:59.94,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}I will make the city burn
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.94,0:23:04.30,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}We're not planning to return
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.06,0:23:08.70,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Trying so hard to be free
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.12,0:23:12.52,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}To make you see what I see
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.89,0:23:17.43,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Hold on to your wishes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.43,0:23:21.25,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}If you can't hold on to me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.45,0:23:25.05,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Forgive me for letting you down
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.94,0:23:30.30,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Forgive me for letting you down again
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.30,0:23:33.50,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}I guess I'm not strong enough
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.12,0:23:37.34,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Right now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.16,0:23:44.70,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Oh my love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.70,0:23:49.03,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.03,0:23:56.32,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}love
Comment: 0,0:23:56.88,0:23:58.88,op-english,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.85,0:22:51.17,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}他们终究会擦出爱情之火
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.17,0:22:55.60,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}火化为血液 在我体内流淌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.60,0:22:59.94,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我会引燃这座都市
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.94,0:23:04.30,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我们从未有撤退的打算
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.06,0:23:08.70,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}努力去获得自由
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.12,0:23:12.52,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}只为让你见我所见
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.89,0:23:17.43,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}牢牢抓住你的期盼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.43,0:23:21.25,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}如果你无法再握住我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.45,0:23:25.05,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}请原谅我 让你失望了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.94,0:23:30.30,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}请原谅我 又一次
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.30,0:23:33.50,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我想还未拥有守护你的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.12,0:23:37.34,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}只为此时
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.16,0:23:44.70,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}哦 我的挚爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.70,0:23:49.03,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我们永恒的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.03,0:23:56.32,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}你我永不分离
